※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4596

※ A record laid out for something else to read is shared with code compiled by
※ something else, which passes a record by rules of its own -- rules this
※ compiler does not follow and does not have to, since a reference is passed the
※ same way by every one of them.

@[abi]
type Ring = state : u64 ; fd : u64

fn holds(r: Ring) → u64:
    r.state

@[startup, impure]
fn main() → u6:
    0u6
